---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{% set prefix = "/en" if lang == "en" else "" %}
<main id="main-content">
  <section class="page-hero page-hero-dark" style="--hero-image: url('/images/web/quality-control.jpg')">
    <div class="container page-hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="{{ prefix }}/">{% if lang == "en" %}Home{% else %}首页{% endif %}</a><span>/</span><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Quality{% else %}质量体系{% endif %}</span></nav>
      <span class="eyebrow">QUALITY SYSTEM / ISO 9001:2015</span>
      <h1>{% if lang == "en" %}Quality control inside the manufacturing route.{% else %}把质量控制放进制造路线。{% endif %}</h1>
      <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Material, process, dimensional and final checks are connected to the approved drawing and the actual blade application.{% else %}材料、过程、尺寸和终检控制，对应确认版图纸和刀具实际应用。{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-system">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">PROCESS CONTROL</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}A four-stage quality path.{% else %}四阶段质量路径。{% endif %}</h2></div><p>{% if lang == "en" %}The detailed inspection plan is defined by product, drawing and application; the website does not publish invented universal tolerances.{% else %}详细检测方案按产品、图纸和工况制定，官网不发布虚构的通用公差。{% endif %}</p></div>
      <div class="quality-flow">
        <div class="quality-flow-step"><b>01 / INCOMING</b><h3>{% if lang == "en" %}Requirement and material{% else %}需求与材料{% endif %}</h3><p>{% if lang == "en" %}Confirm drawing revision, material route and identifiable requirements.{% else %}核对图纸版本、材料路线和可识别要求。{% endif %}</p></div>
        <div class="quality-flow-step"><b>02 / IN-PROCESS</b><h3>{% if lang == "en" %}Process checks{% else %}过程检查{% endif %}</h3><p>{% if lang == "en" %}Connect shaping, heat treatment, machining and grinding controls.{% else %}衔接成形、热处理、机加工和研磨控制。{% endif %}</p></div>
        <div class="quality-flow-step"><b>03 / FINAL</b><h3>{% if lang == "en" %}Final inspection{% else %}终检{% endif %}</h3><p>{% if lang == "en" %}Check the agreed dimensional, material and edge requirements.{% else %}检查已约定的尺寸、材料和刃口要求。{% endif %}</p></div>
        <div class="quality-flow-step"><b>04 / RECORD</b><h3>{% if lang == "en" %}Batch release{% else %}批次放行{% endif %}</h3><p>{% if lang == "en" %}Release against approved criteria and retain key records where applicable.{% else %}按确认标准放行，并按需要保留关键记录。{% endif %}</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">INSPECTION EQUIPMENT</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Real equipment used as visible evidence.{% else %}用真实设备构成可见证据。{% endif %}</h2></div><p>{% if lang == "en" %}The equipment name is taken from the supplied quality material. Accuracy claims are not inferred from the image alone.{% else %}设备名称来自已提供的品保资料，不从图片单独推导精度能力。{% endif %}</p></div>
      <div class="quality-equipment-grid">
        <article class="equipment-item"><img src="/images/quality/spectrolab-spectrometer.jpeg" alt="SPECTROLAB spectrometer" loading="lazy"><div><strong>SPECTROLAB</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Spectrometer / material analysis{% else %}光谱仪 / 材料分析{% endif %}</span></div></article>
        <article class="equipment-item"><img src="/images/quality/cmm-beyond-apex707.jpeg" alt="Mitutoyo BEYOND APEX 707 CMM" loading="lazy"><div><strong>Mitutoyo BEYOND APEX 707</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Coordinate measuring machine{% else %}三次元测定机{% endif %}</span></div></article>
        <article class="equipment-item"><img src="/images/quality/keyence-im7000.jpeg" alt="KEYENCE IM-7000" loading="lazy"><div><strong>KEYENCE IM-7000</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Image dimension measurement{% else %}影像尺寸测量{% endif %}</span></div></article>
        <article class="equipment-item"><img src="/images/quality/nikon-metallographic-microscope.jpeg" alt="NIKON metallographic microscope" loading="lazy"><div><strong>NIKON</strong><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Metallographic microscope{% else %}金相显微镜{% endif %}</span></div></article>
      </div>
      <div class="section-actions"><a class="button button-outline" href="{% if lang == 'en' %}/images/certs/iso9001-en.pdf{% else %}/images/certs/iso9001-cn.pdf{% endif %}">{% if lang == "en" %}View ISO certificate{% else %}查看 ISO 证书{% endif %}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% include "partials/rfq-cta.njk" %}
</main>
